# In Defiant Challenge (jeuno 128), accepted (a GM), at Crawlers' Nest: with OLDSCHOOL_G1 true a ??? does nothing (no
# crumb); with it false again, the clump held and the three crumbs held (a GM): qm10 gives no crumb, and the set cannot
# fuse while the clump is held: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED (the crumbs kept).
lists CrawlersNest/qm10/onTrigger CrawlersNest/qm11/onTrigger
char zone=CrawlersNest pos=-81.9,-8.2,79.1 job=WAR lvl=50
quest Jeuno.InDefiantChallenge accepted
setting OLDSCHOOL_G1 true
login
trigger qm10                            # OLDSCHOOL_G1: nothing
trigger qm11                            # OLDSCHOOL_G1: nothing
setting OLDSCHOOL_G1 false
item ClumpOfExorayMold                  # a GM
keyitem ExorayMoldCrumb1
keyitem ExorayMoldCrumb2
keyitem ExorayMoldCrumb3
trigger qm10                            # the clump held: no crumb; the set, the clump held: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED
